n factory/dispatch.py, persist review state and make the review lane SHA-aware: skip an unchanged head SHA (no duplicate review), allow a changed head SHA to become reviewable again after a REQUEST_CHANGES transition and review it once, end the cycle on approval, and bound attempts using the existing dispatch.review_rounds policy so that exhausting rounds records exactly one escalation event to the human action queue without issuing another automated review. Update factory/dashboard.py to expose the escalation only if required. Add tests in tests/test_factory.py covering unchanged-head, changed-head, approval, and exhausted-round behavior. Verification: run `python -m unittest` and confirm it passes.","author_association":"OWNER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikeroySoft/factory/issues/comments/5622893775/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]